==Trivia==
*This card is part of a narrative illustration with {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Oddish|11}}, {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Bellsprout|18}}, and the illustration rare {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Snorlax|250}} from the same set. In this illustration, Venonat can be seen by one of Snorlax's feet; the Snorlax card reveals that Venonat is stuck in the southern stretch of [[Kanto]] {{rt|12|Kanto}}, which Snorlax is blocking. Together, these cards form the "A Big Snorlax Nuisance" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. Oddish, Venonat, and Bellsprout also have the same stats and an attack that does 20 damage for one {{e|Grass}} Energy.
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Venonat|1}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Venonat}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

